  <para style="h">1 Thessalonians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka đu mưi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Th</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Phaau-lô, lơq Siin-ven nek palơq Ti-mô-thê pagơơi đóng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka kalóóng Yaang Pleng, nek Ama lơq Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih. Nhan ơơn phươk liêm lơq yươq rauha tơơt dhiq adhi anó.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Nôôq yi taluôn ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng leq tabhơt adhi anó, xók kah parngau pahei tơk adhi anó kalóóng nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng ađêi, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />taai hei tơk tarnêêng tââq lóóm huuiq, lơq rau kadhaap nhok tââq lóóm tanhơr, palơq karnóq mưng đươnh tââq lóóm rââm ưng adhi anó dhiq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, toom mat Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he; <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />taai n'nal adhi anó, nôôq manưih bâân Yaang Pleng nh'nhơr, adhi anó bâân Yaang Pleng lưa chââih, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />ơi taai Taruuih Liêm ưng nôôq yi ơi bâân truuih đóng adhi anó eh chapiên palơq bóóp praaq, hơq kung palơq mataai karơ lơq palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm, nek palơq lóóm huuiq dhakơi mưng — kơi adhi anó n'nal nôôq yi ơi mamông n'đó kơi dhiq m'pơng adhi anó ơi malơơi ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Adhi anó kung ơi val xar nôôq manưih ting xamil ưng nôôq yi lơq ưng Chuôq, xók pơh đơơp paraaq Yaang Pleng xók bơk kadhaap kara palơq rau bhuui marhaal ưng Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Patơk mơ, adhi anó ơi val kơi m'beq xamil đóng tabhơt nôôq manưih ve lóóm huuiq dhiq Ma-xê-đoan lơq dhiq A-chaai. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ơi tââq adhi anó, taruuih liêm Chuôq ơi bâân tanđôôr, eh chapiên kalóóng xưưq Ma-xê-đoan lơq kalóóng xưưq A-chaai, bơơi lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó dhiq Yaang Pleng ơi trââi tơk dyóp dhiq. Kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq yi kah lêi kơng phaai praaq ve rau dyơq. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ơi xók pahei leq nôôq yi, chênh piđó đóók truuih lóóiq rau pơh yaauq hơq nôôq yi ơi ve dhiq adhi anó ng'kơi, lơq n'đó kơi adhi anó ơi palâh hóng tââq kabhêi, malóóm leq Yaang Pleng buôn yaauq Yaang Pleng taluôn mamông lơq lalua dhalam, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />lơq buôn đương lêi Akóón Ađó tââq pleng, Yaang đu Ađó ơi payuur mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt — hơq nek Chuôq Jê-su, Yaang trôông paq nôôq he lơh tââq ganơt pagrâ janah xók bhral.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Adhi anó ơơi, chênh adhi anó n'nal kơi tarnêêng nôôq yi tơk palơq adhi anó ơi yươq val xar kah malơơi. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Bơơi xong xók đơơp jarnah lơq bâân kađiq kalươm dhiq kanóón Phi-liip ting kơi adhi anó ơi n'nal, nôôq yi bâân nhóól lóóm kalóóng Yaang Pleng ưng nôôq yi buôn truuih đuui leq adhi anó Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng dhiq bơk rau tarjeng tarjơl. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Ơi tarnêêng bhơơl panhel ưng nôôq yi eh rau gluh tââq rau lơt môôp, kung eh bhral tââq lóóm kah liêm, môôiq tââq lóóm karnóq chachââr galơơk, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Bơơi nôôq yi ơi bâân Yaang Pleng klêêu klôôq buôn bâân pajaau Taruuih Liêm n'đó kơi, nek nôôq yi kung yuur praaq kơi achêk, eh rau buôn têêng iêm lóóm akóón manưih, hơq buôn têêng iêm lóóm Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang chamet lêi lóóm nôôq yi. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Kơi adhi anó ơi n'nal, xók achêk nôôq yi kah tơk palơq nôôq paraaq pei lóóm, môôiq tââq lóóm n'thaam, paxar achak — Yaang Pleng đương lêi — <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />kung kah chik-chêk cha-iil tabah tââq akóón manưih, eh rau tââq adhi anó môôiq tââq manưih lââng, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />dhơ ve chóóm bâân bhi chap taai nek sưưq-đô ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, bơơi tơơt m'pơng adhi anó, nôôq yi kơi ngóq n'niên lóóiq nôôq akóón paniên, dhiêp kơi manưih akan phaai gamang lêi akóón ađêi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Taai nh'nhơr yeh adhi anó kơi achêk, hayơq nôôq yi bhuui lóóm paak blah palơq adhi anó eh chapiên Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq dyơq parhââm mamông ưng chênh ađêi. Achêk nek taai adhi anó ơi val xar nôôq manưih nh'nhơr bhlơng nek palơq nôôq yi. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Nhan móón adhi anó, dhakơi nek adhi anó dyơq hei rau nhưh nhen lơq nhok gleh ưng nôôq yi, nôôq yi ơi truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng leq adhi anó xók dyơq bhiêk matêêng hayum tangêi buôn yươq têêng ganưi haleng leq dhơ dhangaai kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Adhi anó nek manưih truuih, palơq Yaang Pleng dyơq, kơi nek palơq adhi anó, nek nôôq manưih ve lóóm huuiq, nôôq yi ơi mamông sek tabah, bhơt liêm, lơq yươq dhiq chóóm trêh eh alua, <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />kung kơi adhi anó ơi n'nal, n'đó kơi nôôq yi nek palơq ting chanak manưih kalóóng adhi anó, kơi manưih akonh nek palơq akóón anaaq ađêi, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />pahêêl pató adhi anó, bhơơl haanh lơq yua chut adhi anó buôn tơơt cha kơi kre dhalam palơq Yaang Pleng, Yaang dhaloong adhi anó mót kalóóng katiêk pleng lơq cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Taai kơi ađek, nôôq yi kung kah katơng ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, taai xók pơh đơơp paraaq Yaang Pleng tââq rau tameng xâng dhiq nôôq yi, adhi anó ơi pơh đơơp eh rau kơi paraaq ưng akóón manưih, hơq ting pâng dhalam ađek nek paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng, kung nek rau dyơq vôôiq veq kalóóng adhi anó, hơq nek kalóóng nôôq manưih ve lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Nhan móón adhi anó, adhi anó ơi val xar nôôq manưih ting đuui nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng, nek nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt dhiq charhóóng Ju-đê, taai adhi anó ơi đươi palơq nôôq jarnah xangaat tââq chênh dhanuôr ađêi, dhiêp kơi nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq achêk kung ơi đươi tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />nek nôôq đu ơi drươh leng Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su, palơq nôôq manưih loom đââng taruuih, drươh kóóp róp nôôq yi, lơq kung nek nôôq đu kah têêng bhuui lóóm Yaang Pleng, vil dyơq gaam chróót palơq dyóp ngaai, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />xók châq kajơq nôôq yi truuih pachóóm đóng dhanuôr nguôi buôn bơk ngaai ve chóóm bâân paq, đââng tơk matu lơt ưng piđó bhiêk taluôn buur tabing kơơq. Bơơi tơk tatun xariêq, ganơt pagrâ janah dhakơi n'toh dhiq piđó.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Nhan móón adhi anó, dhơ bâân tablah changaai palơq adhi anó kalóóng mơ mưi ganah, dhơ changaai mat bơơi yươq changaai lóóm. Nôôq yi bhơt praan tahươk tahââm kalóóng rau góh rahaal kah kơi buôn lum mat adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Nek hayơq, nôôq yi kiêng vôôiq tơk palơq adhi anó — tââm nek aku, Phaau-lô, bơơr pe chu kanóq vôôiq — bơơi Sa-taan ơi padrơ kajơq nôôq yi. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ơi lóóm rââm, môôiq rau bhuui marhaal, môôiq dhanưưk panơơng tarhơơnh ưng nôôq yi nek harau? Eh alua ađek nek adhi anó tơơt toom mat Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su, kalóóng rau tơk tabhral ưng Ađó kah lua? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Alua, adhi anó nek cha-iil tabah lơq rau bhuui marhaal ưng nôôq yi.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Taai ađek, xók kah đơơp đươnh lơh chóóm, nôôq yi kanóq liêm lơh nek mưi aku phaai bâân tơơt lóóiq dhiq A-thêên, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />lơq nôôq yi ơi kayua Ti-mô-thê, manưih adhi anó ưng nôôq yi lơq dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng Taruuih liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, buôn têêng tamưng karơ lơq tabhơơl adhi anó leq lóóm huuiq ưng ađêi, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />buôn yươq ngaai bâân kadrêq kadrơn m'pơng nôôq bhrê hư ađô. Ơi chênh adhi anó n'nal kơi nôôq he bâân patơơt đơơp taje chiên kơi achêk. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Patơk mơ xók nôôq yi dyơq tơơt palơq adhi anó, nôôq yi ơi loom móón đóng adhi anó kơi nôôq he e đơơp xâng jarnah, lơq tarnêêng yuur avaaih, dhalam kơi adhi anó ơi n'nal. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ơi taai achêk, xók kah đuôh chóóm jruôn đươnh lơh dyơq, aku ơi kayua manưih vôôiq buôn n'nal lóóm huuiq adhi anó n'đó kơi. Ngaai n'nal đu dharơơl galơơk palơq kơi kiq ađek ơi pahêêl kajôông adhi anó lơq kông gleh ưng nôôq yi xar kơi kah malơơi. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Bơơi dhalam bhêêl ađô, Ti-mô-thê lơh xók vôôiq tââq dham adhi anó chô palơq leq nôôq yi, ơi đââng leq nôôq yi taruuih bhuui leq lóóm huuiq lơq lóóm tanhơr ưng adhi anó, kơi adhi anó taluôn jư nôôq rau hei lóóiq liêm kre leq nôôq yi, rââm kiêng tarlum nôôq yi kung thê kơi nôôq yi rââm tarlum adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Taai kơi ađek, nhan móón adhi anó, nôôq yi bâân tabhơơl tââq adhi anó xók taje mat palơq dyóp rau tamenh chêt lơq bhrê hư ưng ađêi, taai lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Tư tââq bhêêl ađô, la chênh adhi anó dyương mưng kalóóng Chuôq, nek nôôq yi mamông. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Nôôq yi ve chóóm tapôông leq Yaang Pleng paraaq ma-ơơn n'đó kơi leq adhi anó, ganương dhiq tabhơt lóóm marhaal marlaat hơq ơi taai adhi anó, nôôq yi bhuui marhaal toom mat Yaang Pleng nôôq yi, <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />hayum tangêi gavơh nhan tabhlơng buôn bâân tarlum mat adhi anó lơq paxóng nôôq rau dyơq tabhuch kalóóng lóóm huuiq adhi anó?<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Gavơh nhan chênh Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, lơq Chuôq Jê-su, Chuôq nôôq he, đââng kalơng nôôq yi tơk palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nhan Chuôq têêng adhi anó yuur tatrul lơq xưa raai kalóóng lóóm tanhơr nek palơq xóng ađêi lơq nek palơq dyóp ngaai, kung pakơi nôôq yi nek palơq adhi anó, <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />buôn têêng đóng lóóm adhi anó mưng karơ, yươq ve rau chóóm jươm kalóóng rau sek tabah toom mat Yaang Pleng, Ama nôôq he, kalóóng rau tabhral tơk ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su, nek palơq tabhơt nôôq akóón dhơn Ađó. A-meen!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Kơi achêk hayơq, tatun xariêq, nhan móón adhi anó, nôôq yi mââl nhan lơq bhơơl pahêêl adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su, dhiêp kơi adhi anó ơi pei đơơp tââq nôôq yi n'đó kơi nek rau kơng bhlơng đóng adhi anó buôn mamông lơq têêng liêm lóóm Yaang Pleng, kung pakơi adhi anó dyơq mamông, hơq đóng adhi anó ve chóóm ruul tơk lơh dyơq. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ơi adhi anó n'nal n'đó nôôq paraaq pachóóm nôôq yi ơi truuih đóng adhi anó tââq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Ơi ađôk nek karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq nek rau vaaih liêm ưng adhi anó: phaai jư ađêi róch changaai rau tapiing taniêt; <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />ting chanak kalóóng adhi anó phaai n'nal jư lêi achak araang ađêi kalóóng rau sek tabah lơq bhi chap, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />kah ting tađuui marlóóch kiêng tââq lóóm (thê kơi dhanuôr nguôi nek đu kah n'nal Yaang Pleng); <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />buôn óóq ngaai têêng lơt lơq kapươk malua adhi anó ađêi kalóóng tarnêêng ađô, ơi taai Chuôq nek Yaang chróót leq dyóp rau ađek, kơi nôôq yi kung ơi loom praaq lơq drêh taniih trêh móón đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ơi Yaang Pleng kah dhaloong nôôq he tơk rau đu anhuq, bơơi mót klóóng rau tabah liêm. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Taai kơi achêk, ngaai kah đươi pachóóm ađô eh rau kah đươi akóón manưih, hơq nek kah đươi Yaang Pleng, Yaang đóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm Ađó leq adhi anó.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Hayơq leq lóóm tanhơr kre liêm bhóng ađêi, adhi anó yươq kơng nôôq yi xaraq đóng adhi anó, ơi chênh adhi anó bâân Yaang Pleng pachóóm phaai tanhơr xóng ađêi. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ơi alua, adhi anó ve têêng kơi achêk nek palơq tabhơt adhi anó plok kalóóng xưưq Ma-xê-đoan. Bơơi adhi anó ơơi, nôôq yi mââl bhơơl adhi anó bhiêk yuur tơk lơh dyơq, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />lơq phaai raan pakarơ mamông paliêm, gamang karaang nôôq tarnêêng ưng ađêi, tââq têi ađêi matêêng, kơi nôôq yi ơi truuih pachóóm adhi anó, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />buôn adhi anó ve chóóm tơơt cha kơi pâng dhalam toom mat manưih nguôi lơq yươq ve rau tabhuch tapiêl.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Adhi anó ơơi, nôôq yi kah kiêng adhi anó kah n'nal rau leq nôôq manưih ơi bêch, buôn adhi anó yươq ranguôq lóóm kơi nôôq manưih lââng nek nôôq đu kah ve lóóm rââm. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ơi la nôôq he huuiq kơi Chuôq Jê-su ơi chêt lơq ơi mamông lóóiq, nek Yaang Pleng kung e đââng nôôq đu ơi bêch tơk palơq Ađó tapâng dhiq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ganương leq paraaq ưng Chuôq, nôôq yi móón rau ađô đóng adhi anó, kơi nôôq he, nôôq manưih xók dyơq mamông, nôôq manưih dyơq tơơt lóóiq đóng patơk bhêêl Chuôq dhaluônh, dhakơi kah vôôiq laloom nôôq manưih ơi bêch. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ơi chênh Chuôq e tââq pleng dhaluônh palơq paraaq kayua, palơq dhariêng ưng dhơn Pleng taha, nek palơq dhariêng karyóól ưng Yaang Pleng, hayơq nôôq manưih ơi chêt kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih e mamông lóóiq laloom tabhơt. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Hayơq tơk nôôq he, nek nôôq manưih xók dyơq mamông, nôôq manưih dyơq tơơt lóóiq, e bâân yuur padyók nek palơq piđó kalóóng garboq dhaluk buôn lum Chuôq dhiq bharyô, lơq kơi achêk, nôôq he e tơơt palơq Chuôq taluôn luôn. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Taai ađek, phaai bhơơl pahêêl xóng ađêi palơq nôôq paraaq ađô.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Adhi anó ơơi, leq tangêi jơ lơq ganah, adhi anó kah kơng nôôq yi xaraq đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Ơi chênh adhi anó n'nal lóng drêh kơi tangêi ưng Chuôq bhral n'đó kơi — kơi đu tatông kalóóng hayum kanam. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Xók palââng móón: “khe liêm lơq yươq rauha,” nek rau chêt bil parmat yuur vaaih dhiq piđó, thê kơi ka-ai luônh ayaai nek palơq manưih pađiil xók đađââng akóón, lơq piđó dhakơi kah leq róch. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Bơơi, adhi anó ơơi, adhi anó yươq tơơt kalóóng bóng kanam, buôn hayơq tangêi achêk avaaih tơk leq adhi anó parmat kơi manưih tatông. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ơi adhi anó maar nek akóón ưng taklaaq brương lơq akóón ưng tangêi. Nôôq he yươq mađó leq hayum môôiq bóng kanam, <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq he óóq bêch kơi nôôq manưih lââng palâh lóóiq, nôôq he kơng meh đương lơq n'taach marngal. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ơi manưih bêch nek bêch xók hayum, lơq đu ból nek ból xók hayum. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Bơơi taai mađó leq tangêi, hayơq nôôq he phaai n'taach marngal xơp aau gróh ưng lóóm huuiq lơq lóóm tanhơr, palơq panơơng bhaxêi — nek lóóm rââm jóói paq. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Taai Yaang Pleng ơi kah kiêng đóng nôôq he đơơp xâng pagrâ janah, hơq buôn đơơp rau paq jóói đươi Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Yaang ơi chêt taai nôôq he, buôn nôôq he, dhơ blââk môôiq bêch, nôôq he maar nek mamông palơq Ađó. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Taai ađek, phaai bhơơl pahei xóng ađêi, manưih ađô phaai tơq hayuur manưih tôôh, kơi adhi anó dyơq xók têêng.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Adhi anó ơơi, nôôq yi nhan adhi anó phaai bhi nh'nhơr nôôq manưih đơơp hadhơơp nhok dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, đââng chơơng adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq, pahêêl yua adhi anó, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />lơq phaai kanóq tơk piđó pakơi bhi chap kalóóng lóóm tanhơr taai tarnêêng têêng ưng piđó. Phaai mamông paliêm palơq xóng ađêi. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Adhi anó ơơi, nôôq yi chut yua adhi anó: phaai patrêh móón manưih kah matich, phaai bhơơl pahêêl manưih kalơm lóóm, phaai tơq hayuur manưih dhur lóóm, phaai jruôn parngau palơq tabhơt dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Phaai chagơn, óóq ngaai pei aak chróót aak đóng ngaai, palâh lóóiq, phaai taluôn ting viêng rau liêm kre, pakoom đóng xóng ađêi lơq đóng dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Phaai taluôn luôn bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Phaai gavơh nhan kah ha-ơt. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Kalóóng bhơt dhơ dharau, phaai ma-ơơn, taai rau ađek nek karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng pakoom đóng adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Óóq tapat Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Óóq kađiq lơơi nôôq paraaq manưih đââng taruuih. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Phaai haliq lêi dyóp rau. Phaai pei jư hau rau nek liêm kre. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Phaai róch changaai lơh dyóp rau đơơp ngóq lơt aak.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Gavơh nhan chênh Yaang Pleng yươq rauha pasek paliêm adhi anó dyóp bhơt, lơq nhan tabhơt lóóm karnóq, ravaai, achak araang ưng adhi anó bâân jư lêi đóng óóq dhiq chóóm trêh xók Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih dhuônh jaq. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Yươq dhơ lóóm alua nek Yaang dhaloong adhi anó, kung nek Yaang e yuur têêng tarnêêng achêk.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Adhi anó ơơi, kung phaai gavơh nhan đóng nôôq yi dyơq.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Nhan tamóh tham tabhơt adhi anó palơq chanum chum liêm. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Aku vơn dhanóók Chuôq truuih leq adhi anó phaai đóng tala thơ ađô bâân đok leq tabhơt adhi anó.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Rââm nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>